      "chunk_type": "worked_example",
      "content_markdown": "উদাহরণ ৬. $$\\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}}{\\sqrt{1+x}-\\sqrt{1-x}} = p$$ হলে, প্রমাণ কর যে, $$p^2 - \\frac{2p}{x} + 1 = 0$$\n\nসমাধান: দেওয়া আছে, $$\\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}}{\\sqrt{1+x}-\\sqrt{1-x}} = p$$\n\n$$বা, \\frac{\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}+\\sqrt{1+x}-\\sqrt{1-x}}{\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}-\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{1-x}} = \\frac{p+1}{p-1} \\text{ [যোজন-বিয়োজন করে]}$$\n\n$$বা, \\frac{2\\sqrt{1+x}}{2\\sqrt{1-x}} = \\frac{p+1}{p-1}$$",
